### ==========================================================
### 认证管理 — 注册/登录/修改密码
### 先运行 #1~#3 注册，复制 username 到 #5，再运行 #5 登录
### 登录后将 token 更新到 http-client.env.json
### ==========================================================

### 1. 注册 - 零售商
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": 1,
  "password": "abc123456",
  "shopName": "小张服装店"
}

### 2. 注册 - 批发商
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": 2,
  "password": "abc123456",
  "shopName": "王老板批发"
}

### 3. 注册 - 买家
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": 3,
  "password": "abc123456",
  "nickname": "李小姐"
}

### 4. 错误测试 - 密码太短
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": 1,
  "password": "123",
  "shopName": "测试店铺"
}

### 5. 登录（把 username 改成注册返回的实际值）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ret_gW989",
  "password": "abc123456"
}

### 6. 错误测试 - 密码错误
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ret_Ab3Xy",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 7. 管理员登录（启动时自动创建）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "heben",
  "password": "heben0831"
}

### 8. 修改密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "abc123456",
  "newPassword": "def654321"
}
